  "project_description": "This module makes it possible to switch to Drupal path based breadcrumbs for taxonomy terms.\n\n By default Taxonomy terms are using their own Breadcrumb implementation . This is overriding the default path based implementation that Drupal uses for other breadcrumbs.\n\n This module enables you to choose between default Taxonomy term breadcrumbs and path based breadcrumbs on a per vocabulary base.\n\n Installation: \n\n \n Enable the module as usual \n go to admin/structure/taxonomy/manage/[vocabulary-name] and configure the setting as you wish.",
